    "detailed_description": "&quot;Urban Chase&quot; immerses players in a lively city chase between police and mischievous thieves. In this whimsical world, players take on the role of a police officer, engaging in thrilling pursuits to apprehend playful troublemakers.<br><br>Currently, players can exclusively experience the game from the perspective of a skillful police officer. Utilize your running skills to navigate the charming low-poly cityscape and apprehend the mischievous thieves who are up to playful antics.<br><br>Features:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700550/extras/5e0f30448036df25e6a3339dd2804977.poster.avif?t=1713699906\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700550/extras/5e0f30448036df25e6a3339dd2804977.webm?t=1713699906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700550/extras/5e0f30448036df25e6a3339dd2804977.mp4?t=1713699906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cute 3D Low Poly Graphics: Immerse yourself in a charming world with adorable characters and a visually appealing low-poly art style.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700550/extras/768422ee08a0d44c0f8f6dd31e2c629f.poster.avif?t=1713699906\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700550/extras/768422ee08a0d44c0f8f6dd31e2c629f.webm?t=1713699906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700550/extras/768422ee08a0d44c0f8f6dd31e2c629f.mp4?t=1713699906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Diverse Stages: Thanks to the 12 stages that become progressively challenging and entertaining, there is no room for boredom.<br><br>Running and Capture: Chase down the mischievous thieves by showcasing your running skills, adding a dynamic element to the pursuit. Enhance your pursuit with boosters and handcuffs, special items designed to aid in the capture.<br><br>Playful Thieves: The thieves in &quot;Urban Chase&quot; are full of mischief, making each pursuit a delightful and unpredictable experience.<br><br>Single-player Focus: As of now, players can exclusively enjoy the game in single-player mode, taking on the role of the police officer.<br><br>&quot;Urban Chase&quot; offers a delightful and lighthearted experience as you dash through the city streets, chasing down playful thieves in this whimsical 3D low-poly world. Get ready for a charming adventure where cuteness meets crime-fighting fun!",
